  - key: body.arm
    hint: the upper limb of the human body from shoulder to wrist (brachium + antebrachium)
    image: body.arm.png
    brief:
      subject: cartoon human arm, side view
      attrs: [simple cartoon style, full arm with elbow, clean lines]
      setting: [white background, centered, clean]
      avoid: [text, hand included, shoulder included, realistic]

  - key: body.leg
    hint: the lower limb of the human body from hip to ankle (membrum inferius)
    image: body.leg.png
    brief:
      subject: cartoon human leg, side view
      attrs: [simple cartoon style, full leg with knee, clean lines]
      setting: [white background, centered, clean]
      avoid: [text, foot included, hip included, realistic]

  - key: body.knee
    hint: the joint in the middle of the leg (genu)
    image: body.knee.png
    brief:
      subject: cartoon human knee joint, front or side view
      attrs: [simple cartoon style, knee highlighted with colour, rounded kneecap visible]
      setting: [white background, centered, clean]
      avoid: [text, full leg, realistic anatomy]

  - key: body.elbow
    hint: the joint in the middle of the arm (cubitus)
    image: body.elbow.png
    brief:
      subject: cartoon human elbow, arm bent at right angle
      attrs: [simple cartoon style, elbow highlighted, bent arm position]
      setting: [white background, centered, clean]
      avoid: [text, full arm, realistic anatomy]

  - key: body.shoulder
    hint: the joint connecting the arm to the trunk (articulatio humeri)
