    brief:
      subject: cartoon human shoulder, front view
      attrs: [simple cartoon style, shoulder joint highlighted, rounded shape]
      setting: [white background, centered, clean]
      avoid: [text, neck, arm, full body, realistic]

  - key: body.neck
    hint: the part of the body connecting the head to the trunk (cervix)
